abstract: >-
  A faithful-by-construction formalization of the old-age pension
  eligibility rules of the Portuguese General Social Security Regime
  (Decreto-Lei n.º 187/2007, original 2007 wording), specified in
  First-Order Logic, implemented in Catala, and machine-verified in
  Lean 4 by an adequacy theorem relating the executable definition to
  the logical specification for every beneficiary. Part of doctoral
  research on formal verification of old-age and invalidity pensions
  within the Rules as Code paradigm. Source code is licensed under
  Apache-2.0; the documentation and formalization text under CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - rules as code
  - formal verification
  - legal informatics
